('older-client fixture v2 limitation and protocol-1 honesty', 'crates/arc-ipc/src/tests/schema.rs', ['tests::schema::modern_version_two_succeeds_but_legacy_count_check_rejects_without_falsifying_count'], 'Modern report version/count 2 succeeds; original count==1 check rejects it. Protocol 1 stays compatible but cannot remove old client semantics. Production stays at version 1.'),
('Malformed/unknown compatibility cannot report success', 'crates/arc-cli/tests/schema.rs; crates/arc-ipc/src/tests/schema.rs', ['unavailable_and_malformed_present_details_fail_without_legacy_fallback', 'inconsistent_or_unknown_success_envelopes_cannot_claim_schema_compatibility', 'tests::schema::present_but_inconsistent_details_never_fall_back_to_legacy_success', 'tests::schema::every_incompatibility_keeps_diagnostic_result_and_prevents_legacy_success'], 'Unknown/inconsistent/unverified schema fails closed with preserved diagnostic error result and no success stdout; legacy fallback applies only to absent schema.'),
