('health responsiveness during real schema and SQL stalls', 'crates/arc-daemon/tests/worker_runtime.rs', ['health_completes_while_schema_assessment_is_deliberately_stalled', 'health_completes_while_native_sql_preparation_is_deliberately_stalled', 'controlled_slow_database_does_not_block_health_and_cli_recovers'], 'Controlled native preparation/assessment stalls establish active DB work while actual health/status complete independently, then doctor recovers. This does not claim unconditional health under all transport saturation.'),
